    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10755" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contemplātus</span></b> ,
			ūs, m.
		contemplor. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A consideration, contemplation, observance</i>
			(very rare, and only in <i>abl. sing.</i>): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mali,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 5, 7, 66</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Regard, respect</i>, <i><span class="en">Macr.
				Somn. Scip. 1, 1, 5</span></i>.</div>
